  "body_text": "Hear from experts across Meta starting at 10:00 AM PT. Tune in to watch it live.\n\n                                                    ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­\n\nWatch the developer state of\n\nthe union live\n\nTune in\n\nToday's keynote laid out what's next across AI glasses, VR, Horizon, and our AI models and products. Tomorrow at 10:00 AM PT, the Meta Connect developer state of the union streams live to cover how you can start building.\n\nTune in tomorrow for a closer look at each area:\n\nAI glasses: Explore new ways to build for AI glasses, from web apps and mobile experiences to agentic tools. Plus, discover the latest updates to the Wearables Device Access Toolkit and design best practices.\n\nVR: Start building for Meta VR Glasses, the next generation of Meta VR, with the v207 SDKs.\n\nAI models and products: Build with Muse Spark, Muse Code and Muse Voice through the Meta Model API, and deploy agents that work inside a messaging thread with Meta Business Agent Platform.\n\nHorizon: Explore new creation capabilities with Horizon Create and Horizon Studio, plus how we’re helping you reach more players across Facebook, Instagram and Horizon.\n\nWatch live tomorrow at 10:00 AM PT , and stick around to stream developer sessions on demand afterward.\n\nWatch Live\n\nThis message was sent to purchasing@sesameaccess.com. If you don’t want to receive these emails from Meta in the future please unsubscribe.\n\n© 2026 Meta. Meta Platforms, Inc., 1601 Willow Rd. Menlo Park, CA 94025 or where the Meta Products are offered to you by Meta Platforms Ireland Limited, 4 Grand Canal Square, Grand Canal Harbour, Dublin 2, Ireland\n\nPlatform Policy Privacy Policy Terms Unsubscribe",
