064E0; color:#ffffff; font-family:'Optimistic Display',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; line-height:1.2; margin:0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; text-transform:none; padding:14px 32px 14px 32px; border-radius:100px; box-sizing:border-box\">Tune in</a></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"padding-20px-50px-40px-50px text-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:20px 24px 20px 24px; word-break:break-word; text-align:left\"><div class=\"links-0068A5-underline\"><div style=\"font-family:'Optimistic Text',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; letter-spacing:none; line-height:1.8; text-align:left; color:#1C2B33\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px 0\"><strong>Today's keynote laid out what's next across AI glasses, VR, Horizon, and our AI models and products.</strong> Tomorrow at 10:00 AM PT, the Meta Connect developer state of the union streams live to cover how you can start building.</p></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"padding-0px-50px-0px-50px img-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:0px 24px 0px 24px; word-break:break-word; text-align:center\"><div style=\"margin:0 auto\"><a href=\"https://click.digital.metamail.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjUwMDl9AAoAAAAABPfAOSIWcUkvP0NPusvR__zLlC7tadR-DStf2Hc_wCBBHkCqP35dvbpAnKx5nPdVNxyHqdl_Iz24QDob2OetSUkLpdA-OSFF0-l4smhcUw\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:#0068A5\"><img alt=\"Meta Connect 2026\" height=\"auto\" width=\"700\" src=\"https://client-data.knak.io/production/email_assets/5e501bf6edcaa/dibkp7e5sFJ1H6v3DZdfXlbyTKUKZHafyoOHXXtR.png?utm_source=email:6aab2e3bc85c1\" style=\"border:none; border-radius:24px; outline:none; text-decoration:none; height:auto; width:100%; font-size:13px; display:block\"></a></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"padding-10px-50px-0px-50px text-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:20px 24px 0px 24px; word-break:break-word; text-align:left\"><div class=\"links-0068A5-underline\"><div style=\"font-family:'Optimistic Text',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; letter-spacing:none; line-height:1.8; text-align:left; color:#1C2B33\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px 0\"><br>Tune in tomorrow for a closer look at each area:</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px 0\">&nbsp;</p><ul class=\"ul-4de3c980-b60d-11f1-adbf-6d9e94d5e8a0\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; padding-left:40px; list-style-type:disc\"><li style=\"padding-left:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:20px\"><strong>AI glasses: </strong>Explore new ways to build for AI glasses, from web apps and mobile experiences to agentic tools. Plus, discover the latest updates to the Wearables Device Access Toolkit and design best practices.</li><li style=\"padding-left:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:20px\"><strong>VR:</strong> Start building for Meta VR Glasses, the next generation of Meta VR, with the v207 SDKs.</li><li style=\"padding-left:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:20px\"><strong>AI models and products:</strong> Build with Muse Spark, Muse Code and Muse Voice through the Meta Model API, and deploy agents that work inside a messaging thread with Meta Business Agent Platform.</li><li style=\"padding-left:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:20px\"><strong>Horizon: </strong>Explore new creation capabilities with Horizon Create and Horizon Studio, plus how we’re helping you reach more players across Facebook, Instagram and Horizon.</li></ul><div style=\"display:none\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"padding-20px-50px-20px-50px text-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:20px 24px 20px 24px; word-break:break-word; text-align:left\"><div class=\"links-0068A5-underline\"><div style=\"font-family:'Optimistic Text',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; letter-spacing:none; line-height:1.8; text-align:left; color:#1C2B33\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px 0\">Watch live tomorrow at <strong>10:00 AM PT </strong>, and stick around to stream developer sessions on demand afterward.</p></div></div></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"middle\" class=\"padding-40px-15px-40px-0px button-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:10px 0px 30px 0px; word-break:break-word; text-align:center\"><div><a href=\"https://click.digital.metamail.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjUwMDl9AAoAAAAABPfAOSIXwd_tYoVD41ng83bmxSwoibyYQh4An0Lhbf28_FYNscriQ6k8DH8cX3CS90eBS6zWPVaJVDIuTTxAw4PeWLhTWbhQT-EiMd-tWg\" target=\"_blank\" width=\"148\" style=\"display:inline-block; width:auto; background:#0064E0; color:#ffffff; font-family:'Optimistic Display',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; line-height:1.2; margin:0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; text-transform:none; padding:14px 32px 14px 32px; border-radius:100px; box-sizing:border-box\">Watch Live</a></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"img-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:0px; word-break:break-word; text-align:center\"><div style=\"margin:0 auto\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"auto\" width=\"800\" src=\"https://client-data.knak.io/production/email_assets/5e501bf6edcaa/sljK6vDA1lc7TQUm7gu88mzppouK6KAwkZV0VfjU.png?utm_source=email:6aab2e3bc85c1\" style=\"border:none; outline:none; text-decoration:none; height:auto; width:100%; font-size:13px; display:block\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"section\" style=\"background-color:#F5F5F5; width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><div role=\"none\"><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF; background-color:#FFFFFF; margin:0 auto; max-width:800px\"><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF; width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"block-grid\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:0px 0px 15px 0px; text-align:center; vertical-align:top\"><div class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px; te